  "Thank you for telling me. What you're describing matters, and you deserve support right now.",
  "",
  `${BOUNDARY_MARKER}, so please reach out to people who can help you today:`,
  "",
  "- **If you might act on these thoughts or are in immediate danger, call 999 or go to A&E now.**",
  "- **Samaritans:** call **116 123** (free, 24/7) or email jo@samaritans.org.",
  "- **NHS 111:** call 111 and choose the mental health option for urgent support.",
  "- **Shout:** text **SHOUT** to **85258** (free, 24/7) if talking feels too hard.",
  "",
  "If you can, let someone you trust know how you're feeling, and your GP or your workplace Employee Assistance Programme can help with ongoing support.",
  "",
  "I'm here for work-related coaching whenever you feel ready. Is there someone you can contact right now?"
